{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18163","headline":"奉酬振武胡十二丈大夫 · 韩愈","name":"奉酬振武胡十二丈大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾朝共羡宠光频，半岁迁腾作虎臣。\n戎斾暂停辞社树，里门先下敬乡人。\n横飞玉盏家山晓，远蹀金珂塞草春。\n自笑平生夸胆气，不离文字鬓毛新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}